i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kIILKJ7UNjoQ7kNvwH6GO7u&_nc_oc=AdomkHmK-SvJqG5Jg4ql5x7KZB-QamBXo8RRozIJ9R0FtRVkpnhLyIHLAuHdyjFEZZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNJRB0ZIZ61YBeWIfwbOnRhx1p8hU791VuCBJ1Layt_6w&oe=6AE0A2A3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yy6ZdOdvRpMQ7kNvwHEtgcQ&_nc_oc=AdrgrmfCMiGzPQ7fsUZ-NkSTVFo33bBjOV18X29sPfjp4fMjw9Gd3C6MnNtYosYOM7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOoeh6XRqkN2je1NTG4_X97Mx4mfNAgExRyTf1KrPBm6A&oe=6AE0C6DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yWgHMu9qIo0Q7kNvwExnz1s&_nc_oc=AdqnpfUij6dsw6xhMQaTFtxbw9Zgoj_mhT24RRMOvqPjU0A7gEQDL3NZGypeV0v_Lt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPm0IrVFnRAUhYjhpRuFBpDbLzMUAhYNM47ld9BNinnZA&oe=6AE0B54A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im